\newlabel{fig:performance}{{1}{14}{Task-dependent divergence in semantic augmentation sensitivity across perturbation conditions. Prompt-constrained structural augmentation (C4a) is associated with the largest directional shift on BBBP, though post-hoc verification reveals C4a outputs are predominantly Contextual Confabulation rather than Structural Phantom type (see Section~\ref {sec:taxonomy})}{figure.1}{}}
\def\@LN@column{1}
