\newlabel{tab:c4_compliance}{{3}{19}{Post-hoc taxonomy classifier verification of prompt-constrained conditions (C4a--c). ``Target'' indicates the intended hallucination type based on prompt design. Compliance rate = proportion classified as the target type. Verification was applied to a representative sample of $n=47$--49 molecules from the BBBP test set}{table.3}{}}
