\newlabel{fig:taxonomy}{{6}{20}{Distribution of hallucination types in naturally generated (C3) descriptions. Contextual Confabulation (CC) dominates at approximately 80\%, with Structural Phantom (SP) occurring rarely (2.4\% of BBBP outputs). This distribution reflects C3 free-generation outputs only; prompt-constrained C4a--c conditions were verified separately and are discussed in the text}{figure.6}{}}
